       "message": "core-unit publication -- ",
       "disposition": "INTENTIONALLY_NO_MUTATION_CASE",
       "reason": "The ship-only condition needs a coherent full-family record bound to the current source, baseline and verification environment; a single-file mutation cannot construct that known-good lifecycle or turn focused evidence into full proof. Dedicated fixtures in tools/test_t1828_verification_policy.py prove focused-only refusal, current full acceptance, stale-source refusal and new-red refusal; the release-executor wiring test also refuses before invoking the external validator. The live validate.py ship block calls that same publication_gate. This records its invariant and independent fixtures, not a full publication PASS or a mutation CASE that was never run."
