+an unreadable home has one stand-in, the machine runtime (RUNTIME.md):
+`%ProgramData%\SAI\SAIPEN\bin\saipen.cmd` (RUNTIME.md). No route:
+SAIPEN_HOST_RUNTIME_UNAVAILABLE; no hand checkpoint, DONE, commit or push.
