 # SAIPEN Execution Policy
 
-Owners: STYLE voice; CORE lifecycle/safety; this document delivery.
 Priority: higher host instructions > user/safety/CORE > execution > STYLE.
 
 <!-- RULE-OWNER: EXEC-RESPONSE-01 -->
@@ -24,7 +23,7 @@
